","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"望月 侑","creatorId":"vndb:s17887","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17887","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17887","name":"望月侑","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:195970","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"アーサー石井","creatorId":"vndb:s24218","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24218","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24218","name":"アーサー石井","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:195973","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"夏花","creatorId":"vndb:s3225","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3225","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3225","name":"波野夏花(夏花)","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:195974","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c126880","characterName":"戦巫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"133666","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"430691"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24670"],"vndbCharacterId":"c126880"},"originalCharacterName":"戦巫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Scared? Not at all. Protecting people from the malevolent Night Demons—that's my role as the Warrior Priestess of the Mikosono clan.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Himeka, the story's main heroine, is the sole heiress of the esteemed Mikosono family. Not just a pretty face, she's an all-around talent who also manages the Ouma Shrine. Everyone in school knows who she is, not just because she's from a well-known shrine family. She's got this warm and open vibe that makes everyone, teachers included, look up to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In her other life, Himeka is a Sennagi—a warrior priestess fighting off the evil Night Demons. She willingly participates in the \"Shinji\" (divine ritual) to ramp up her spiritual power for the battles ahead. As fate would have it, her classmate, Souma, is more than just another face in the crowd. He's her partner in the Shinji and her ally against the Night Demons—even if she hasn't figured it out yet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c126880"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のメインヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"桜舞周辺の魔祓いを取りまとめ、桜舞神社の宮司を務める、神子園家の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗、文武両道、そして有名な神社のお嬢様ということで、学園内でも名前を知らない人はいない有名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでいて、決してお高くとまることはなく、誰にでも分け隔てなく接するため、学生からも教師からも一目置かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一族の掟に従い、『戦巫』として夜魔と戦うべく、『神事』という名の調教儀式に身を捧げる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトになった主人公とは、学園での交流を通して親睦を深めていくが、 彼が『神事』の相手役で、ともに夜魔と戦う相棒であるということには、まだ気づいていない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24670","sourceWorkId":"34261","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のメインヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"桜舞周辺の魔祓いを取りまとめ、桜舞神社の宮司を務める、神子園家の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗、文武両道、そして有名な神社のお嬢様ということで、学園内でも名前を知らない人はいない有名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでいて、決してお高くとまることはなく、誰にでも分け隔てなく接するため、学生からも教師からも一目置かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一族の掟に従い、『戦巫』として夜魔と戦うべく、『神事』という名の調教儀式に身を捧げる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトになった主人公とは、学園での交流を通して親睦を深めていくが、彼が『神事』の相手役で、ともに夜魔と戦う相棒であるということには、まだ気づいていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"133666"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24670","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24670","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"159 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24670","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24670","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"62 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24670","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/0687975bde1d27355837f0adfa2792203b9c9c32ebff0eae689fa92aee12e7c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb2be8fddbc410a1da50ba46ee60a2cf1f99d78212545b7f7b5fd1dd288c9fdd.webp","width":169,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青葉りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s295","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s295","name":"青葉 りんご","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:430691:133666:5922:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c126881","characterName":"伏守 奏真","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"133669","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"430691"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24671"],"vndbCharacterId":"c126881"},"originalCharacterName":"伏守 奏真","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"It's neither due to my family's mission nor as penance for my role in the ritual. I vow to protect Himeka and her resolve of my own free will.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Souma, the tale's central figure, has come to Ouma City in line with a longstanding agreement between the Mikosono and Fusemori clans. In a world of rituals and divine obligations, he stands as Himeka's ordained partner. At first glance, he might seem intense, even intimidating, thanks to a natural sternness in his eyes and a speech pattern more formal than expected for his age. Yet, this masks an indomitable sense of justice—a need to assist anyone in distress, whether human or beast."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Fusemori family, although being exorcists, hail from a lineage of Night Demons and have physical capacities far superior to ordinary humans. A unique artifact further enhances Souma's powers—the Wolf Mask—allowing him to morph into a white wolf and bolster Himeka's crusade against the creatures of the night."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Under the shroud of darkness, Souma becomes Inugami, the wolf-masked Mayoi focused on ritualistic tasks and skirmishes with the Night Demons. By daylight, he's the new guy in class, gradually connecting with Himeka on an emotional level while preserving his hidden persona."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c126881"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古来より神子園家と伏守家の間に結ばれてきた約定に従い、『神事』における姫華の相手役として、桜舞市にやってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目で我慢強い性格。生まれつき目つきが悪く、口調も年のわりに固いため怖いと誤解されがちだが、 助けを求めている者は人間でも動物でも放っておけない、強い正義感の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伏守家は魔祓いでありながら夜魔の一族で、普通の人間より数段高い身体能力を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに特別な神器である狼面によって、人から白狼へと変身し姫華の戦いをサポートする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夜は『神事』の執行役兼ともに夜魔と戦う狼仮面の魔祓い“犬咬イヌガミ”として、 昼は転入生でクラスメイトの伏守奏真として。正体の秘密を抱えながら、姫華と関わり心を通わせていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24671","sourceWorkId":"34261","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古来より神子園家と伏守家の間に結ばれてきた約定に従い、『神事』における姫華の相手役として、桜舞市にやってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目で我慢強い性格。生まれつき目つきが悪く、口調も年のわりに固いため怖いと誤解されがちだが、助けを求めている者は人間でも動物でも放っておけない、強い正義感の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伏守家は魔祓いでありながら夜魔の一族で、普通の人間より数段高い身体能力を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに特別な神器である狼面によって、人から白狼へと変身し姫華の戦いをサポートする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夜は『神事』の執行役兼ともに夜魔と戦う狼仮面の魔祓い“犬咬”として、昼は転入生でクラスメイトの伏守奏真として。正体の秘密を抱えながら、姫華と関わり心を通わせていく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"133669"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2638e2bdb4d2fbd4f21d9967511cf666c79c80370d802edd7526a9ed1f5dd6a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7ff9f5b390a2c5f15ebfc774171629f3669f59961cbd7d761363d49013bd776e.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c126888","characterName":"エル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"133670","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"430691"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24672"],"vndbCharacterId":"c126888"},"originalCharacterName":"エル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"149"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Elle's all about having fun. Pain and hardship? Boring~\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Elle is one of four \"Yama\" (Night Demons) who have appeared in Ouma City. She is a playful and youthful girl called \"Kaiki\" (Wandering Ogre) by local exorcists."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She exhibits a cheerful and carefree demeanor, characterized by rapidly shifting and unpredictable moods akin to a typhoon. Her golden rule? If it's not fun, it's not worth doing. This devotion to hedonism sets her apart, as she pursues joy with unmatched zeal. Still, don't be fooled by her apparent airheadedness. Behind the facade, Elle's mind is razor-sharp."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even among other Night Demons, Elle stands out with her extraordinary regenerative abilities and physical strength. In battle, she wields an illegally modified chainsaw with surprising ease."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c126888"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"桜舞市に現れた四夜魔の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本の魔祓いたちからは、“廻鬼カイキ”と呼ばれている、小悪魔な少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく無邪気で、熱しやすく冷めやすい、台風のような気分屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何も考えていないような言動と振る舞いが目立つが、頭の中では以外と冷静に物事を捉えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"徹底して『楽しく生きること』が第一の快楽主義者で、『楽しくないこと』は絶対しない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他夜魔と比べてもケタ外れの再生能力と膂力を持ち、違法改造したチェンソーを軽々振り回して戦う。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24672","sourceWorkId":"34261","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"桜舞市に現れた四夜魔の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本の魔祓いたちからは、“廻鬼”と呼ばれている、小悪魔な少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく無邪気で、熱しやすく冷めやすい、台風のような気分屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何も考えていないような言動と振る舞いが目立つが、頭の中では以外と冷静に物事を捉えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"徹底して『楽しく生きること』が第一の快楽主義者で、『楽しくないこと』は絶対しない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他夜魔と比べてもケタ外れの再生能力と膂力を持ち、違法改造したチェンソーを軽々振り回して戦う。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"133670"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24672","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"c","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24672","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"149 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24672","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24672","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24672","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/05825de28f92fe20db0a2e04d19fda5ef87cf82dca8f10d5b0a4ab459e1f8828.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7afca2ad8c336a04929424b1c92e87077686803cc4dbcdca07716c643918ac4f.webp","width":169,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"乙倉由依","creatorId":"vndb:s26305","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26305","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26305","name":"乙倉ゆい(乙倉ゅい、乙倉由依、愛花むぎ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:430691:133670:48849:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c126889","characterName":"サーリャ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"133671","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"430691"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24673"],"vndbCharacterId":"c126889"},"originalCharacterName":"サーリャ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"93"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Sadness and suffering are now things of the past. Now, won't you drown in wonderful love within me? \""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the enigmatic Night Demons to appear in Ouma City is a woman of sultry allure and sensual presence. Known among Japanese exorcists as \"Enki,\" the \"Seductive Ogre,\" she embodies an uncanny blend of voluptuousness and mystique."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sallya carries a tranquil presence but isn't shy about taking the initiative. She radiates a profound empathy and compassion even towards those who bear her ill will, displaying an uncharacteristic depth of understanding."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first glance, she may appear harmless, but her words wield a power that directly interferes with the minds of others. Those who engage her in conversation soon find themselves ensnared, viewing Sallya as a mother figure or a lover. Eventually, these unfortunate souls succumb to their carnal desires, only to have their vital energies sapped away, leaving them but empty husks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c126889"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"桜舞市に現れた四夜魔の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本の魔祓いたちからは『艶鬼』と呼ばれている妖艶で肉感的な女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで争いを好まないが積極的な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何者に対しても敵意を向けず、自分に敵意を持つ者にも深い慈愛と共感を示す思慮深さがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見して無害な存在だが、彼女の言葉には『他者の精神に干渉する』という力があり、対話した者はサーリャを母や恋人のように愛し、肉欲に溺れ、やがて精気を奪い尽くされてしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24673","sourceWorkId":"34261","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"桜舞市に現れた四夜魔の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本の魔祓いたちからは、“艶鬼”と呼ばれている、妖艶で肉感的な女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで争いを好まないが積極的な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何者に対しても敵意を向けず、自分に敵意を持つ者にも深い慈愛と共感を示す思慮深さがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見して無害な存在だが、彼女の言葉には『他者の精神に干渉する』という力があり、 対話した者は、サーリャを母や恋人のように愛し、肉欲に溺れ、やがて精気を奪い尽くされてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"133671"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24673","sourceWorkId":"34261","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）"